<title>ITALY: BANK OF ITALY SETS 5.0 TRILLION LIRE REPO TENDER.</title>
<headline>BANK OF ITALY SETS 5.0 TRILLION LIRE REPO TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 5.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on August 18.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 9.0 trillion lire on August 4, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.77 percent and the average rate at 6.79.</p>
</text>
